<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Clayton Homes cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Clayton Homes cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs cut Clayton Homes Inc to market perform from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Clayton Homes dropped 1/2 to 14-1/2 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
